# Una credencial por dispositivo. Cada uno solo toca lo suyo.

user gateway
topic write wsp/in
topic read  wsp/out

user brain
topic read  wsp/in
topic write wsp/out
topic write casa/cmd/#
topic read  casa/evt/#

user agent
topic read  casa/cmd/cam/#
topic write casa/evt/cam/#
topic write casa/evt/agent/#

# Un ESP32 por boyero. No puede ni ver los topics de cámaras.
pattern read  casa/cmd/boyero/%u/#
pattern write casa/evt/boyero/%u/#
